# Empty template: one JSON object per candidate-pool case.
# Do not commit participant-level or reviewer-level observations to this repository.
# See data/evaluation/outfit-review.schema.json and docs/evaluation/outfit-evaluation-protocol.md.
# Required case structure: schema_version, case_id, participant_key, session_id,
# assigned_system ("cirvanna" or "baseline"), context, candidate_outfits,
# cirvanna_ranked_look_ids, human_reviews, adjudications, exposures.
# Every candidate look requires exactly two distinct reviewer_key annotations.
# If reviewers disagree, an independent adjudicator is required.
# User exposure outcomes must correspond only to the randomized arm's top-k.
